{"quest_id": 6401, "name": "魔界大戦・序章", "description": "・魔界：味方の攻撃力と防御力が半減\n・コストの自然回復/ＥＸＰ/ゴールド/ドロップなし\n・ライフが０でもミッションクリア", "event": "魔界大戦・序章", "event_category": "Subjugation", "mission_id": 400183, "map_no": 4016, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 10, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 26, "params": [50]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 27, "params": [50]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 17}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 1250, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 1250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 4000, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 118, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111376, "special_effect_id": 270, "master_id": 30921, "global_id": 4540, "spawn_sec": 22}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 63, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["エスネア＆エフネのファン"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 15, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 66, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2107936, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 958, "global_id": 957, "spawn_sec": 45}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 17, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 142, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098272, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 82, "global_id": 81, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 17, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 70, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 20, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104096, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 498, "global_id": 497, "spawn_sec": 113}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 15000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 90, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2098288, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 231, "global_id": 230, "spawn_sec": 276}], "popups": ["　　　　【魔界の瘴気】\n攻撃力と防御力が低下します。\n王子【神器装備】王子【ケラウノス】\n皇帝を配置すると攻撃力と防御力の\n低下について無効化することが\nできます。\n一部ユニットも無効化できます。", "魔界審判がいる間は\n敵の攻撃力と防御力が大幅に\n低下します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "グレーターデーモン", "text": "……ガード様。\nこの村で兵たちに『補給』をさせてやるべきかと。", "face": "l824e83580e24"}, {"name": "ガード", "text": "ふむ……確かにそうだな。\n遠路の行軍で兵卒どもの士気も落ちていることだ。", "face": "l64435e35b2b3"}, {"name": "ガード", "text": "ここはひとつ、\n荒武者どもの破壊衝動を満足させて……ん？", "face": "l64435e35b2b3"}, {"name": "グレーターデーモン", "text": "あれは――お、王子たち！？\nなぜ……ヤツらがここに？", "face": "l824e83580e24"}, {"name": "グレーターデーモン", "text": "……いや、理由などこの際どうでもいい。\n総員、戦闘用意！　敵は前方の人間どもだ！\nここであの忌々しい英雄の末裔の息の根を――。", "face": "l824e83580e24"}, {"name": "ガード", "text": "――待て、グレーターデーモンよ。\n魔界では満足に力を発揮できぬ人間共を\n一方的になぶり殺しにしても面白くはない。", "face": "l64435e35b2b3"}, {"name": "ガード", "text": "それに、ここで我らが圧勝すれば兵どもはおごる。\nそうなれば、いずれ物質界に侵攻した折に\n万全の状態で迎え撃つ敵から思わぬ痛手を被るだろう。", "face": "l64435e35b2b3"}, {"name": "グレーターデーモン", "text": "ん？　お、お待ちください！\nまさか、『魔界審判』を行使して\n兵たちの戦力を低下させるおつもりですか！？", "face": "l824e83580e24"}, {"name": "ガード", "text": "兵どもの真価を見極めるためだ。\n人間共に対する有利を解消した程度で敗れるようなら、\nもとより彼の地を攻め落とすことなどできまい。", "face": "l64435e35b2b3"}, {"name": "グレーターデーモン", "text": "ぐっ……聞け、誇り高き魔王軍の戦士たちよ！\nガード様が『魔界審判』を発動された！", "face": "l824e83580e24"}, {"name": "グレーターデーモン", "text": "これで諸君らに地の利はなくなった！\n諸君ら自身の実力が今、問われているのだ！", "face": "l824e83580e24"}, {"name": "ガード", "text": "……往くぞ、グレーターデーモンよ。\nもはや我らがここにいる必要はない。\n兵刃飛び交う戦場で血煙を上げるのは兵卒共の仕事だ。", "face": "l64435e35b2b3"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map400183_4016", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 936, "y": 484}, {"k": "b", "x": 31, "y": 487}, {"k": "m", "x": 176, "y": 483, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 299, "y": 480, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 209, "y": 263, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 239, "y": 361, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 349, "y": 371, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 394, "y": 292, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 314, "y": 193, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 470, "y": 205, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 557, "y": 276, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 631, "y": 383, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 637, "y": 487, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 723, "y": 317, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 839, "y": 268, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 553, "y": 131, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 524, "y": 489, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 414, "y": 487, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 750, "y": 487, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 850, "y": 487, "id": 217}, {"k": "r", "x": 602, "y": 206, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 474, "y": 308, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 304, "y": 276, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 764, "y": 428, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 98, "y": 416, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 166, "y": 412, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 646, "y": 278, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 856, "y": 409, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 553, "y": 413, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 808, "y": 358, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 526, "y": 353, "id": 310}]}, "active": true}